1002	// With a direct source->report edge added on top of the merge scenario, edge
1003	// count takes priority over lexicographic order: report shortens to distance 1
1004	// and view to 2, both via the new edge, and the lexicographically smaller
1005	// length-3 route through a must not survive. The a/z and b/c branches remain
1006	// reachable on their own. The new upstream's position in report's declared
1007	// list must not change the result.
